00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:45.090
First, ML can be used to solve
many problems for which you're

00:00:45.090 --> 00:00:46.740
writing rules today.

00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:49.370
In fact, a great way to find
opportunities to apply it

00:00:49.370 --> 00:00:51.890
is to look for rules
in your business.

00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:54.020
For example, query
completion in Google Search

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:56.990
used to be a real tangle
of handcrafted rules.

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:59.780
Applying machine learning to
it brought our biggest boost

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:03.140
